Use the 32-bit cameraserver with the C5 HAL1 recording path, as in 18.1.
The provider's shared VideoNativeHandleMetadata and the camera service's
view of that structure must agree on the pointer size and offset. Keep
cameraserver separate from mediaserver and use Binder handle transport.

